  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Race around36fairground holes and physically bumper-whack giant animated
    moles before they dive underground. Ordinary brown moles score10, rare golden
    star moles score50. Black helmet/red-cross decoys deduct25 and blast your real
    tractor into a bounded cartoon tumble. Your front bumper must touch an exposed
    target at0.8m/s or faster. Inactive holes, stationary overlap and repeated contact
    never score. Every emergence has a new one-hit identity. The number of active
    moles increases and exposed windows shrink over the match. Highest score wins;
    equal scores share placing and negative scores are possible. Choose2,3or4minutes,
    up to4human drivers and8competitors, Easy/Normal/Hard AI or AI-only spectating.
    AI physically drives to emerged targets and can make difficulty-dependent decoy
    mistakes. Safe recovery never awards points. Shared arena, independent chase/cab,
    free look, optional AI views, crew identity, shared weather and horn use collection
    controls. Watch the actual recorded match at results without changing scores.
